<#@ template language="C#" inherits="IntentTemplateBase<Intent.Modelers.Services.CQRS.Api.CommandModel>" #>
<#@ assembly name="System.Core" #>
<#@ import namespace="System.Collections.Generic" #>
<#@ import namespace="System.Linq" #>
<#@ import namespace="Intent.Modules.Common" #>
<#@ import namespace="Intent.Modules.Common.Templates" #>
<#@ import namespace="Intent.Metadata.Models" #>
<#@ import namespace="Intent.Modelers.Services.CQRS.Api" #>
<#@ import namespace="Aryzac.GitHubIssues.Api" #>
---
id: <#= Model.Id #>::<#= GetHttpSettingsDefinitionId() #>
title: "task(api): <#= GetVerb() #> <#= GetRoute() #> for <#= Model.Name #>"
type: task
<# if (Model.HasGitHubIssueClosed()) { #>
closed: true
<# } else { #>
closed: false
<# } #>
---
<# if (Model.HasBusinessRequirement()) { #>

### Business Goal

<#= Model.GetBusinessRequirement().Summary() #>
<# if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Model.Comment)) { #>

<#= Model.Comment #>
<# } } #>

### Scope & Notes

| Property | Type | Nullable | Description |
|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
<# foreach (var property in Model.Properties) { #>
| <#= property.Name #> | <#= property.TypeReference.Element.Name #> <#= property.TypeReference.IsCollection ? "[]" : "" #> | <#= property.TypeReference.IsNullable ? "Yes" : "No" #> | <#= string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(property.Comment) ? "" : property.Comment #> |
<# } #>

Estimated Effort
Estimated Days: 0.5

| Task                                               | Target Hours     | Actual Hours |
|----------------------------------------------------|------------------|--------------|
| Confirm query handlers/DTOs exist                  | 0.25h            |              |
| Implement controller GET actions                   | 0.5h             |              |
| Ensure validators cover pagination/ordering        | 0.5h             |              |
| Integration tests (id, list, pagination/isolation) | 1.25h            |              |
| Documentation updates                              | 0.25h            |              |
| Buffer                                             | 0.25h            |              |
| Total Target Hours                                 | 3.0h (≈ 0.5 day) |              |

Acceptance Checklist
- [ ] Query handlers (GetById + list) implemented and return DTOs
- [ ] Controller GET actions call mediator only (no DbContext)
- [ ] Validators enforce id/pagination/ordering rules (or N/A documented)
- [ ] AsNoTracking + ProjectTo used in handlers
- [ ] NotFoundException flows to 404 for missing ids
- [ ] Integration tests cover happy path + pagination + multi-tenant/soft delete isolation
- [ ] Documentation updated (this recipe referenced)
- [ ] Effort variance >20% captured in issue comments
